\\\ 0 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -2 & -0.1 & -0.1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nQ = \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$\nR = \\begin{bmatrix}5 & 3 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "- The matrix $P$ has $3$ rows and $3$ columns. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 3.$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- The matrix $Q$ has $3$ rows and $1$ column. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 1.$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- The matrix $R$ has $1$ row and $3$ columns. So, its dimensions are $1\\times 3.$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, only $R$ is a $1\\times 3$ matrix."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186476075 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f31a0b9-2fef-5eaa-87af-bb0a3c63440b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476014} {:answer/id #uuid "fff7f120-2bb5-532e-a3e9-76b09917fbbc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476101}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186476014} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b087b51-55b4-50c4-b133-3ae94ba7b324" :answer-field/key "C" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476031} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0dcdcadb-095c-5666-8b70-541477a2a5f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476007} {:answer/id #uuid "a08371e3-9910-5738-b93c-2fccf69d3666" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476062}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186476007} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b4d6048-2f95-58d0-adee-35a1047e0d23" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476038} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "830e65e0-4b45-5bd6-aca5-4b8d6e1df764" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186476050} {:answer/id #uuid "ef576372-0fad-5556-b4e4-f0306535f911" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921860454